\section{Mapping Telemetry to Boundary Conditions}

Boundary conditions are updated using:
\begin{equation}
    Q_{\text{boundary}}(t) =
    Q_{\text{baseline}}(t) + \Delta Q_{\text{telemetry}}(t),
\end{equation}
where:
\begin{itemize}
    \item $Q_{\text{baseline}}$ is the unperturbed manifold,
    \item $\Delta Q_{\text{telemetry}}$ is the observational correction.
\end{itemize}

Corrections are applied gradually using:
\begin{equation}
    \Delta Q_{\text{smooth}}(t) =
    \int_0^t \Delta Q_{\text{telemetry}}(\tau)
    e^{-(t-\tau)/\tau_s} d\tau,
\end{equation}
with smoothing timescale $\tau_s$ preventing numerical shock.

